### ============================================================================
### ADMIN & METADATA ENDPOINTS
### ============================================================================
### Endpoints administrativos y metadatos

@api = https://servicioshilda.orioncaribe.com/api/v1
@adminToken = your_admin_jwt_token_here

### ============================================================================
### 1. GET /admin/metadata/api - API Metadata
### ============================================================================
### Obtiene información de la API (versión, endpoints, etc.)

GET {{@api}}/admin/metadata/api

### Response should be 200 OK with:
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "version": "1.0.0",
###   "name": "ProWallet API",
###   "environment": "production",
###   "uptime": 3600,
###   "endpoints": [...]
### }


### ============================================================================
### 2. GET /admin/metadata/endpoints - Endpoints List
### ============================================================================
### Lista de todos los endpoints disponibles

GET {{@api}}/admin/metadata/endpoints

### Response should be 200 OK with complete endpoints list


### ============================================================================
### 3. GET /admin/metadata/contract - Contract Metadata
### ============================================================================
### Metadatos del contrato inteligente

GET {{@api}}/admin/metadata/contract

### Response should be 200 OK with contract information


### ============================================================================
### 4. GET /admin/stats - Global Statistics
### ============================================================================
### Estadísticas globales del sistema (solo admins)

GET {{@api}}/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{@adminToken}}

### Response should be 200 OK with:
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "totalUsers": 1500,
###   "totalTransactions": 8000,
###   "totalVolume": "5000 SOL",
###   "activeWallets": 1200
### }


### ============================================================================
### 5. GET /admin/system-health - System Health
### ============================================================================
### Verificación de salud del sistema completo

GET {{@api}}/admin/system-health
Authorization: Bearer {{@adminToken}}

### Response should be 200 OK with system status


### ============================================================================
### 6. POST /admin/maintenance-mode - Enable/Disable Maintenance Mode
### ============================================================================
### Activa o desactiva modo de mantenimiento

POST {{@api}}/admin/maintenance-mode
Authorization: Bearer {{@adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enabled": true,
  "message": "API under maintenance. Please try again later.",
  "estimatedDuration": "1 hour"
}

### Response should be 200 OK


### ============================================================================
### 7. GET /admin/logs - Get System Logs
### ============================================================================
### Obtiene logs del sistema (solo admins)

GET {{@api}}/admin/logs?limit=100&level=error
Authorization: Bearer {{@adminToken}}

### Response should be 200 OK with logs


### ============================================================================
### 8. POST /admin/cache/clear - Clear Cache
### ============================================================================
### Limpia la caché del sistema

POST {{@api}}/admin/cache/clear
Authorization: Bearer {{@adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "all"
}

### Response should be 200 OK
